<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">Overview</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">The Financial Backbone of Your Organization</h2>
        <p>
            The general ledger forms the unbreakable core of the ERP system. Every operational transaction — from
            a stock receipt in a remote warehouse to a retail sale at a POS terminal — posts automatically
            to the ledger. This native integration ensures that your financial statements are always a
            true reflection of your operational reality, eliminating month-end reconciliation delays.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Native multi-currency support enables organizations to operate in Zimbabwe's
            dual-currency environment, maintaining transaction integrity in both USD and ZiG while
            adhering to IFRS presentation standards.
        </p>
    </div>
